{"id":1764747,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-06T14:20:43.201Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1764747,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["RU"],"original_language":"ru","original_title":"Рахманинов. Литургия","overview":"An immersive journey into the sacred space of artistic creation. For twelve days, the ancient walls of the Cathedral of the Nativity of the Virgin in Veliky Novgorod became a recording studio, where a young team from St. Petersburg took on the ambitious task of recording Sergei Rachmaninoff’s Liturgy of St. John Chrysostom. The camera captures something almost impossible: the pursuit of acoustic perfection and the encounter between Rachmaninoff’s genius and centuries of prayerful silence. This is a story not only about music, but also about overcoming artistic challenges, technical difficulties, and human doubts. The film builds a bridge between the great legacy of Russian culture and its vibrant, living present.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Russia"}],"release_date":"2025-11-13","revenue":0,"runtime":65,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Russian","iso_639_1":"ru","name":"Pусский"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Rachmaninoff. Liturgy","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"RU","title":"Rakhmaninov. Liturgiya","type":"Transliteration"}]},"external_ids":{"imdb_id":null,"wikidata_id":null,"facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":6459980,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Dmitry Yushkov","original_name":"Дмитрий Юшков","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6a9cf6055fdf1993a9d1946d","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":6459980,"known_for_department":"Direct